24. PA5 comparte LD2." (at 25 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 941d12bd-af83-4f54-9ce2-431899373bb2)) (text "GY-91: 5V sin conectar. NCS/CSB/SA0 sin conexion EXTERNA por instruccion del usuario.\nPENDIENTE: polarizaciones, I2C pull-ups y retroalimentacion al alimentar por 3V3. NO VALIDADO." (at 25 202 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid b0bd8238-72db-40a6-9505-55491d0a000f)) (text "Waveshare: VSYS.39 / VBUS.40 / LoRa_ANT.29 sin conectar. SIN BATERIA.\nPin 33 AGND sin conexion interna GND en esquema del modulo.\nFirmware: RF switch por DIO2; validar TCXO por DIO3." (at 25 221 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 84f6c0fb-e8e4-4b6d-a4fd-c85e16231838)) (text "PCB 70 x 82.5 mm. F.Cu + B.Cu, pistas 0.6 mm, agujeros metalizados.\nConector J5: control al ESC y GND. Motor brushless NO se conecta a GPIO.\nESC ZMR bidireccional 30A: confirmar umbral logico de 3.3 V." (at 25 245 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5245d64c-472d-4cc4-bf55-ea25f647eaff)) (symbol (lib_id "Shield2:NUCLEO_CN7") (at 74.93 59.69 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid 4d64341a-7301-4a1b-be9d-554242983892) (property "Reference" "J1" (at 74.93 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Value" "NUCLEO CN7 ST MORPHO" (at 74.93 53.339999999999996 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Footprint" "Shield2:Morpho_2x19_PTH" (at 74.93 59.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 74.93 59.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (pin "1" (uuid f331f29d-6570-4511-85a4-c608e8efceeb)) (pin "2" (uuid e93a258b-625d-414c-84df-49acef39840d)) (pin "3" (uuid 8335a67d-f71c-4ce2-a58a-7c474b528f6b)) (pin "4" (uuid ac0c3acb-45bb-4a6e-884b-dcf524b273c1)) (pin "5" (uuid ac6c881d-3334-4063-a022-0d7dfd011bc8)) (pin "6" (uuid 9281f283-250c-421b-bf61-6c7b8aaff026)) (pin "7" (uuid 0e03dbb3-2e91-4ea0-a1f8-f261e23c7197)) (pin "8" (uuid c53